+                  multiplicative=False, step=0.1):
+    """
+    Roots of fun on either side of center, where fun(center) < 0.
+
+    The bracketing point is searched outwards from center, additively
+    or multiplicatively, unless a bound is given. Returns (lower, upper),
+    with None for an endpoint that cannot be bracketed.
